# Shared Services API calls for API Self-Service & Credential Lifecycle.
# consumerKey: copy it from Consumer App A's subscription after you accept it.
# revokedKey: paste a key after you revoke it in the Gamma console.
# Keep real key values out of this file.

### Backend health
GET http://localhost:8140/v1/health

### Backend service list
GET http://localhost:8140/v1/services

### Gateway list without a key
GET http://localhost:8082/shared-services/v1/services

### Gateway list with the Consumer App A key
GET http://localhost:8082/shared-services/v1/services
X-Gravitee-Api-Key: {{consumerKey}}

### Gateway get service-001 with the Consumer App A key
GET http://localhost:8082/shared-services/v1/services/service-001
X-Gravitee-Api-Key: {{consumerKey}}

### Gateway list with a revoked key
GET http://localhost:8082/shared-services/v1/services
X-Gravitee-Api-Key: {{revokedKey}}
